# ILMerge exclude file
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Other lines are treated as regex
# patterns matched against the FULL type name (namespace + name) of types
# in the merged assemblies. Matching types are marked `internal` in the
# output assembly, which keeps the public API surface of ModFramework clean.
#
# By default, leave this file EMPTY — ILMerge will then keep all merged
# types public, which is what we want for the `HarmonyLib` and
# `Newtonsoft.Json` namespaces (mods need to call into them).

# Examples (uncomment to use):
# ^HarmonyLib\.AccessTools$    ← keep only this Harmony type public; hide the rest
# ^Newtonsoft\.Json\.Schema$   ← hide the JSON Schema types (we don't use them)
